    "['vpn-target [parameter1] export-extcommunity', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'route-target export 111:1', 'parent_command': ['interface [parameter1]', 'vrrp [group_id] ip [ip_address]'], 'root': 'interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nroute-target export 111:1\\n##\\n\\nExplanation: \\n- In Huawei's configuration, `vpn-target 111:1 export-extcommunity` is used to specify the route target for exporting VPN routes.\\n- The equivalent Cisco command is `route-target export 111:1`, which serves the same purpose of marking routes for export to the specified VPN community.\\n- Both commands use the same format for the extended community value (111:1).\", 'trans_template': 'route-target export 111:1'}]]": 1,
